# These paths are intentionally absent from `main` (agent-tooling and planning
# docs, not needed in production/on the VPS). The `merge=ours` driver makes a
# `dev` -> `main` merge keep main's deletion automatically instead of
# resurrecting these files or hitting a modify/delete conflict every release.
# One-time local setup required per machine that performs the merge:
#   git config merge.ours.driver true
.claude/** merge=ours
AGENTS.md merge=ours
CLAUDE.md merge=ours
client/CLAUDE.md merge=ours
engine/CLAUDE.md merge=ours
server/CLAUDE.md merge=ours
workspace/** merge=ours
